  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 28 October 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nBeautifully refreshed and filled with natural light, this stunning family home combines relaxed coastal living with a warm, contemporary feel. Natural earth tones and a calming palette create a home that feels inviting from the moment you walk through the door.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, expansive open plan living and dining gives everyone room to come together, while large sliding glass doors create effortless indoor outdoor flow. Step out onto the generous covered deck and take in views across the neighbourhood towards the sea. Whether it’s morning coffee, summer barbecues, long lunches or drinks at the end of the day, this is a space designed to be enjoyed year round.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by lush tropical gardens and established palms, the outdoors has a relaxed coastal feel with plenty of room for kids and pets to play, plus space for the trampoline. You may even spot one of the local Kereru perched nearby.\r\n\r\nOne of the home’s real strengths is its layout, with a separate wing providing valuable privacy and separation from the main living areas. It’s ideal for family life, giving everyone their own space while still keeping the main living areas at the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nEasy care and low maintenance, it’s also an ideal lock up and leave for those wanting a home that’s effortless to enjoy.\r\n\r\nWaiake Beach is within walking distance, while Torbay’s shops, cafés and restaurants are just a short distance away. Families will also appreciate being in zone for Glamorgan School, Torbay School and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nSunny, spacious and beautifully presented, this is relaxed coastal living designed around the way families actually live.",
